<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN V NEW ZEALAND FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN V NEW ZEALAND FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
